			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150080201,
					"content": "Wow, there are a lot of Koholasaurs here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080202,
					"content": "As expected, the first clue is related to the Koholasaurs.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080203,
					"content": "When people from outside the tribe get a copy of the map, most can deduce that the first clue is related to the Koholasaurs, but they often end up looking in the wrong direction.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080204,
					"content": "When the first chief created the map, he left a special mark for this part. It's a code that the tribe uses to indicate a herd of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080205,
					"content": "So, it'll be impossible to gain any leads from just finding one or two stray Koholasaurs.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080206,
					"content": "You're a real pro at this, Mualani!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080207,
					"content": "But according to the information I've been able to find, Koholasaurs don't like gathering as herds unless it's to compete for the hot springs...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080208,
					"content": "So let me tell you a secret that only a guide from the People of the Springs would know. It so happens that wild Koholasaurs periodically gather in the valley up ahead.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080209,
					"content": "It's almost like how our tribe gathers together for festivals. Still, as soon as the season changes, the herd quickly disperses again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080210,
					"content": "Unless you're a guide who's always running across Natlan, it would be very rare to ever witness such a thing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080211,
					"content": "This is a thing!? I need to note this down right away, and include an explanation as a part of my thesis...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080212,
					"content": "According to what I've deciphered from the map, a clue is hidden deep in that valley.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080213,
					"content": "But to get there, won't we have to get through the herd of Koholasaurs?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080214,
					"content": "Hmm, we'll have to think of a way to sneak past without startling them. They're gathering together with their friends, so I'm sure they don't want to be disturbed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080215,
					"content": "You mean, we're going to have to walk through the Koholasaur herd? That feels a little...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080216,
					"content": "Ahem... Given we've agreed to work together, everyone should do their part. However, Karya has been attacked by Koholasaurs before, so this isn't an ideal plan for her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080217,
					"content": "But it shouldn't be a problem at all for me! Let's have Karya wait here and I'll take over all the tasks that were supposed to be entrusted to her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080218,
					"content": "Hehe, no worries. We don't need everyone to go.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080219,
					"content": "#We actually need someone to stay and look after the luggage, so we'll leave that to you two. {NICKNAME}, Paimon, please come with me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080220,
					"content": "Is that so? Then that works out perfectly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080221,
					"content": "And now I understand how much you care for your assistant scholar.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				}
			]
		},
