			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150080501,
					"content": "We must be getting close.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080502,
					"content": "Look, a bunch are gathering around that rock. What're they doing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080503,
					"content": "Hmm, maybe when things start to get boring, they gather together and talk about something fun? Too bad I can't understand what they're saying...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080504,
					"content": "But, Paimon thought guides from the People of the Springs could understand Koholasaurs.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080505,
					"content": "Sounds like someone has been trying to trick you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080506,
					"content": "True, they were definitely trying to scam us... Huh? Do you see that on the rock? It looks like some kind of... drawing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080507,
					"content": "I've heard that there is a type of moss that changes color when it reacts to the biological signals released by Koholasaurs. But to trigger that sort of reaction, you'd need a huge number of Koholasaurs...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080508,
					"content": "That must be the clue!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080509,
					"content": "Should we take a picture?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080510,
					"content": "The flash might disturb them. Let me try to copy it down.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080511,
					"content": "Mualani copies down the mossy drawing and quietly leads you back the way you came. You then tell the patiently waiting Viramdra and Karya everything you saw and heard.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150080512,
					"content": "So we've passed the first stage of the journey now, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080513,
					"content": "I see... Had we chosen to drive the Koholasaurs off, then we never would've found this lead... Seems there was a logical basis for everything you said after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080514,
					"content": "Has he always been this way, Miss Karya?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080515,
					"content": "He's just obsessed with his research, that's all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Karya"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080516,
					"content": "At least this has shown that my judgment is correct. I've proven my trustworthiness. And so, there should be no need for us to argue next time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080517,
					"content": "Yes, I understand... and I suppose that'll help us avoid wasting time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Viramdra"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080518,
					"content": "Mualani really knows how to lead our group!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080519,
					"content": "She is a professional guide, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080520
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150080520,
					"content": "Next, we'll need to use the lead we found to uncover our next destination. Now, what does this pattern represent?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080521,
					"content": "Hard to tell... Paimon certainly doesn't have any idea what it's trying to get at.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080522,
					"content": "Aha! I got it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080523,
					"content": "Though the lines are kinda rough, I can still see that they represent the boundaries between the water and the land at Jadeskirt Knoll. We can use this to fill in the hole on the map and...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080524,
					"content": "Find our next destination!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080525,
					"content": "Really? You got all that just from some rough lines?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080526,
					"content": "Well, intuition is also a part of it. Maybe I've just seen too many maps as a guide, and now it's easier for me to pick up on patterns like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150080527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150080527,
					"content": "Alright, break time is over, let's get ready to move!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				}
			]
		},
